<title>AUSTRALIA: BHP changes peformance targets.</title>
<headline>BHP changes peformance targets.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Resources giant the Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd (BHP) would drop the group's internal performance target of a 15 percent return on equity and instead focus on measuring itself against its peers, Managing Director John Prescott said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The objective of the company is to perform at a level that's in the upper 20 percent of companies against which it is appropriate to compare itself, both in terms of its ongoing performance and in terms of growth,&quot; Prescott told a media briefing.</p>
</text>
